        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2296] If [V2G20-2295] applies, the EVCC shall stop and then restart the SDP process when V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timer is equal or larger than V2G_EVCC_Ongoing_Timeout and no parameter EVSE_Processing equal to \"Finished\" has been received.",
